  "description": "Shenora launcher: the native applier that runs BEFORE your app and applies a staged update, for framework-dependent apps whose runtime may be absent and whose files may be held open. Ships per-RID binaries (win-x64, linux-x64) plus the C++17 library sources and the main.cpp template, so you can use the stock launcher or build your own from the same library. A self-contained app needs none of this — Shenora.IO's UpdateStage.ApplyAsync already applies updates in portable .NET.",
